30.
RESOLUTION—Authorizing the Mayor and the City Clerk to sign a Final Plat for the 5th
Street Towns, City of Cheyenne, Laramie County, Wyoming (located southeast of the
intersection of West 5th Street and Snyder Avenue). (SPONSOR
— MR. ROYBAL)
Dr. Rinne moved to adopt with acknowledgement of relief in a) reducing the number of parking
spaces per unit from 2 to I and b) reducing the rear setback, seconded by Mr. Segrave. Motion
carried with Dr. Rinne and Mr. Segrave voting “YES” and Mr. Laybourn voting “NO.”
Connor White, Planning & Development Department, provided a staff report and Brandon Swain,
developer, provided detailed information related to the proposed development. Committee
members Laybourn and Segrave commented on the item.
31.
